No arquivo DESCRIPTION do seu pacote
voce coloca campos como Depends, Suggests etc


vaja o o manual Writing R extensions e/ou o arquivo de outros pacotes

Por exemplo na geoR tenho:

paulojus@pj:~$ more geoR/DESCRIPTION
Package: geoR
Version: 1.7-2
Date: 2011-11-15
Title: Analysis of geostatistical data
LazyLoad: yes
LazyData: yes
Author: Paulo J. Ribeiro Jr <paulojus em ufpr.br> and
         Peter J. Diggle <p.diggle em lancaster.ac.uk>
Maintainer: Paulo J. Ribeiro Jr <paulojus em ufpr.br>
Depends: R (>= 2.10), stats, sp, methods, MASS, tcltk
Imports: splancs, RandomFields
Suggests: scatterplot3d, geoRglm, lattice, graphics
Description: Geostatistical analysis including traditional, 
likelihood-based and Bayesian methods.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: http://www.leg.ufpr.br/geoR



