    F6rec4      -15.53000    0.74810 -20.7592 < 2.2e-16 ***
    F6rec5        0.47000    1.16994   0.4017   0.68788    
    ---
    Signif. codes:  0 ‘***’ 0.001 ‘**’ 0.01 ‘*’ 0.05 ‘.’ 0.1 ‘ ’ 1 


